	end
}
script 12 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"지금 OK 버튼을 눌러."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 13 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"드디어 배틀 시간이야!\n저 녀석들을 해치워 버리자!\n아, 그전에..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"왼쪽 아래에는\n커스텀 화면에서 선택한 카드가"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"선택한 순서대로\n표시돼."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 14 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"오른쪽에는 지금 사용할 수 있는\n카드의 이름과\n공격력이 표시돼."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 15 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"A 버튼을 누르면\n배틀 카드를 사용할 수 있어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"B를 계속 누르고 있으면\n록 버스터가\n멈추지 않고 발사돼!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"배틀 카드는 A,\n록 버스터는 B...\n알겠어!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그리고 왼쪽 위에 있는 게\n내 HP 맞지?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 16 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"정답이야.\nHP가 0이 되면\n게임 오버니까 조심해!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"오른쪽 위의 게이지는\n커스텀 게이지라고 해."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 17 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"커스텀 게이지는 시간이 지나면\n차오르지."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"커스텀 게이지가 가득 차면 눌러서\n커스텀 화면으로 돌아갈 수 있어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"L 또는 R."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"그럼 카드 6장을 전부 사용해도\n커스텀 화면에서 카드를\n더 가져올 수 있겠네..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"바로 그거야!\n준비됐어, 꼬맹이?\n연습을 시작하자!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"응, 준비됐어!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
